Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:53.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:08.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:14.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:20.85,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:25.85,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:29.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:32.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:38.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:45.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:51.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:54.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:02:02.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:08.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:24.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}面向未來　擁抱夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:28.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}下定決心　仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:34.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}用我的翅膀跨越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:38.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}你才是我命中注定之人 !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:42.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}我宣布　絕對love !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:48.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}閃亮的季節漸漸逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:52.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}紀念照裡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.99,0:22:56.93,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}是那一成不變的　困惑的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:03.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}溫柔地　溫暖地　讓我淚水盈眶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:08.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}預感明天也能在此相見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:12.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}不需要約定　去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.09,0:23:16.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}像往常一樣若無其事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:21.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}笑著揮動小手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:26.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}{\fad(0,1000)}「那麼…明天見。」
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到普朗克頓賓館
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,經理  客人已經登記好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會迅速辦理投宿的客人的退房手續
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  和預知裝置的預知一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就拜託你們引導避難了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是VIP待遇的主顧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要有禮貌地接待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注入真心的接待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然要去的話  就去這樣的賓館
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,決定了  決定要特殊超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐  發生事件了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}48th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「理力騷然！看不見的威脅」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼交易成立了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  今後也請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們送酒菜來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛤？  我們沒有叫啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是經理的款待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.06,0:02:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有必要  滾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這麼說嘛  大家就收下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客廳裡三人  門後一人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  我們是有些過激的客房服務
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正忙著…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意  念動整理床鋪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是特殊超能力者嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答正確
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我將兩位VIP帶到特別席位去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這幫傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  我想要實彈而不是橡膠彈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的在旁邊的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在預知裡  那混蛋會使用炸彈造成大慘劇…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了  是瞬移嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是你  做得好  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上把犯人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你這混帳嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停手  到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙差點就把皆本給…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不行  必須要抑制住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力…力量收不回來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點打開限制器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大腦的各個部位都有細微的損傷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒辦法抑制住自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要在意了  大家都平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼作為獎勵親我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,約好了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著  我什麼時候和你定下了這種約定…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是個大意不得的人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過看起來很有精神  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  直美  朧小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  我們馬上要去執行任務
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距離事故發生還有二十分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  馬上就去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能去  醫生叫停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外  不要在這裡脫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這畫面很不妙的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次讓直美去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子很飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音？  是錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能快點找到失蹤者就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替我向直美問好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.09,0:05:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽的傷沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可是我必須要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有想讓媽媽受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我用超能力讓媽媽受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也是  我差點就…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  蠢女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:05:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀嗬  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪…澪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哭？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦  囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是灰塵掉進眼睛裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來  你還想和我打嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨…笨蛋  我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火腿豬排三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同伴讓我來叫你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當啊！  炸肉餅真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洋芋片是清湯紫菜鹽味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吃嗎  可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我才不想借助你這種人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要和黑色幽靈戰鬥需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了啊  還擔心她會不會乖乖來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  澪和女王是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰和她是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰和我是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正是不可能去拐這種孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這樣做的話就失去意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們全都是P.A.N.D.R.A嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我把你們全都抓起來也沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有本事你就來啊  B.A.B.E.L的深閨大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦能傳達給我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛看不見  無法呼吸  無法集中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念力在下降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢小看我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子是怎麼回事  限制器明明還是打開的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下去  卡茲拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  空氣的防護罩？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動爆裂粉碎拳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適可而止吧  卡茲拉  賈利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是什麼蠻力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能把剛才的當成是自我介紹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是卡茲拉  他是賈利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是加納紅葉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是以瞬間移動能力為基礎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠固定一部分空間
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠻力就是這個能力的應用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  這樣的蠻力…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我沒有限制器的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭…又…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限制器的電波中斷了  發生什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？  啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  什麼事也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為撞了一下  可能壞掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬不要使用超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在亂來的話可能會引發腦內出血的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在在洗澡  先掛了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在浴室裡接電話？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在這附近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎被海流沖到西邊去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  向西邊移動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點找到早點回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有向B.A.B.EL告發我們真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼事情就快點說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和黑色幽靈戰鬥是怎麼一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到那個了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的超能力者搭在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  果然在裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要痛扁這傢伙  你來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛機爆炸了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面有乘客的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣做的話不就知道誰是敵人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一丁點的犧牲罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正他們都是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你們這幫傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去救乘客們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是黑色幽靈…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按我說的去做！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話  我也是你們的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女…女王
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  我說的沒錯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動緊急降落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派蒂·庫魯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛機被攻擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想目標應該是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手段非常兇狠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方是P.A.N.D.R.A吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此  就把在那裡的人全都殺掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,P.A.N.D.R.A是礙事的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  黑色幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為你  害我們失去了先下手的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事和我無關  我根本就沒來過這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的  天色這麼暗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上我的墨鏡和帶來的假髮  沒人看得出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼隨身帶著假髮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今還做什麼表面工夫啊  你平時不也是這麼做的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會確認有沒有乘客  而且國家會賠償的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些超能力罪犯就自己去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著  我們需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈是全體超能力者的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能全交給B.A.B.E.L處理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們P.A.N.D.R.A也想和他們對抗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你們的增幅器的複製品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼時候做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們沒有像你一樣能夠合成翅膀的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能和我們並肩作戰  讓我們搜集數據
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們獲得了少佐的許可的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她本人答應的話  那就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我身體狀況不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎  你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的工作是和桃太郎一起保護女王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記住了  不管發生什麼都要保護女王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你用不著擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你深受少佐喜愛  又有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身邊還有很多珍視你的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我們不同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們大家都是很相似的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不能原諒那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被少佐和P.A.N.D.R.A所救
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也要以牙還牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}よう！パティ·クルーよ{\r}\N喲  我是派蒂·庫魯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ようし{\r}\N好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}いくぞ！{\r}\N上囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是P.A.N.D…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,P.A.N.D.R.A With 謎之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謎之…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我和他們不太一樣的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他們不是同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不是  但也和實際存在的人物團體是沒關係…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了  閉嘴笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個故事當然是虛構的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼啊  這個混帳小子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是男的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過是五到十個笨蛋  馬上就收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來  黑色幽靈已經許可了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不過是被那幫傢伙利用了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我醒醒吧  看我把你揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這個本事的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些煙是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起煙來更像是灰塵…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  看我把這些一起燒掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賈…賈利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是粉塵爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙用身體釋放出來的粒子包圍了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來輪到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將身體本身變成了粒子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是物理攻擊無法奏效的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼對抗  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我慢著  現在才問我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般都是建立好作戰才來找我的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一上場就打  一想到就馬上執行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是P.A.N.D.R.A的宗旨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能先下手為強的話\N對方是什麼能力就都沒關係了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪和桃太郎保護女王  散開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  你到這邊來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有可是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招  空氣導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這小東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼吸…沒辦法呼吸…好痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬眠模式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去援護
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有制定作戰怎麼能回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰？！  要怎麼做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在在想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本就沒有思考的能力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我在思考啊  你給我等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要到什麼時候啊  幾點幾分  星期幾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保護女王是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:44.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是最優先事項
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐是這樣對我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼總是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要的東西你全部都有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為這是理所當然的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你從小就被大家愛護的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒有這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用不著來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有想讓媽媽受傷  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L的人說了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和尿床是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是因為還小  自己有無論如何也沒辦法控制的時候而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽不想讓你看到她受傷的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是因為你看了之後會在內心留下傷痕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然可能很難受
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這也是為了保護你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是被保護的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…那個…怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了你  讓我回憶起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我也不是總尿床的小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被保護的份  我要好好地還回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區區笨蛋還真頑強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如計劃一般…說不出口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了提升女王的興致  本來是想演一場苦戰的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再這樣下去真的會很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我醒來  賈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.49,0:16:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變更預定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用管搶救了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那傢伙的射程外燒死她  給她致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實你只要說我就能明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡茲拉  五秒後脫離
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五！四！三！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二！一！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  到這邊來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要增幅的話就只有現在了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  這裡是哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Question！Question！  我是桃太郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,增幅模式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ON
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這幫傢伙也能用的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這麼難受的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量被吸走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  力量不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然不是葵和紫穗的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動強制解放
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很重視我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我自己所想的要遠遠…遠遠地…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也想重視這些人們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  我不會一直是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了  黑色幽靈的咒縛被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是勉勉強強吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪…那個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介也希望澪能夠回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.15,0:18:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會發出那個的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在你也是…有家人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…給我振作點！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛細血管出血了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用瞬移把血弄出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賈利用念力止血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能得救嗎  這樣就能得救嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰！薰！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是緊急處理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想少佐的話應該是完全治好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快點叫少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我怎麼冷靜啊  你這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回房治療吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比B.A.B.E.L的花花公子蒙古大夫要能幹的多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.43,0:19:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…我並沒有在擔心的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超級傲矯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈  我是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵照您的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  把她束縛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動神之手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這表示增幅器還不夠完美嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派蒂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木兄在看顧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說完全解除似乎很困難
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要花點時間  應該會有辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非這還兼帶我們和女王的配合的測試嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還周到地準備了喬裝用的假髮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遲鈍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬眠的表演也很行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要打腫臉充胖子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和她一起戰鬥的感想如何
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為她具有女王的資質
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪好像也認可女王了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼時候認可了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再傲矯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只…只是  同伴中有個幸福的大小姐也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為她並沒有這麼幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而這一點對於女王來說是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為她在最重要的時期沒有牽住她的手的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是很重要的問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等有一天你們伸出手的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她會因為自己也搞不清楚的理由而無法拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這是她小時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一渴求的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我把今晚的記憶消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把薰的記憶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是無法完全解救派蒂的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事情我還不想讓B.A.B.E.L和女王知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我們的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是奪不走的  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搶救平安無事地結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  睡熟了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是吃了飯乖乖睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊  那就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  行動的記憶好像異常井井有條…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也去洗個澡早點睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天也要上學的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也不會永遠是小孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？  沒有吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你們這麼遲都沒回來  我一直一個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…  咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了  給我去睡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不握住我的手的話  我睡不著睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才不是睡得很熟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼至少…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱枕  Come Here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:21:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渾身濕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生你這色狼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大膽了
