Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱抱我  好寂寞～
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是小孩子嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
